WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.330 --> 00:00:13.040
Strange as it sounds – accountants in Russia
live dangerously.

00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:26.240
Article 160 of the Russian criminal code: Embezzlement.

00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:28.289
I worked in real estate management.

00:00:28.289 --> 00:00:37.470
Fraud is endemic – you find it in nearly
every company in the industry.

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:39.670
Usually the boss shoulders responsibility
for that.

00:00:39.670 --> 00:00:44.150
But here in Russia it's usually the person
who brings the prosecution that wins.

00:00:44.150 --> 00:00:45.559
That's what my boss did.

00:00:45.559 --> 00:00:47.090
He filed charges against me.

00:00:47.090 --> 00:00:50.020
My 'guilt' was quickly proven.

00:00:50.020 --> 00:00:56.680
The investigator said to me: 'You won't walk
free – your case fills 19 files and it's

00:00:56.680 --> 00:00:58.290
a year-long investigation.'

00:00:58.290 --> 00:01:07.620
The 
state prosecutor was looking for a three year

00:01:07.620 --> 00:01:08.620
sentence.

00:01:08.620 --> 00:01:09.890
In the end I got two.

00:01:09.890 --> 00:01:20.050
First, I was on remand.

00:01:20.050 --> 00:01:23.070
The time on remand was worse than being in
prison.

00:01:23.070 --> 00:01:26.000
I was in a small cell with forty other prisoners.

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:27.940
They were always there.

00:01:27.940 --> 00:01:30.690
I had no privacy.

00:01:30.690 --> 00:01:34.250
When I then went to prison, I lost all hope;
I had no more dreams.

00:01:34.250 --> 00:01:50.890
I just waited for it all to end.

00:01:50.890 --> 00:01:52.120
It was awful.

00:01:52.120 --> 00:01:57.229
Awful being ripped out of your familiar surroundings
and put into strange new surroundings.

00:01:57.229 --> 00:02:00.840
It was a world that wasn’t exactly pleasant.

00:02:00.840 --> 00:02:03.090
They took my family away from me.

00:02:03.090 --> 00:02:16.240
Even though it was only me that was convicted,
in the end my whole family suffered.

00:02:16.240 --> 00:02:19.680
Visits were only allowed every four or five
months.

00:02:19.680 --> 00:02:25.400
I didn’t know how I would survive the separation,
without the chance to hug and kiss my loved

00:02:25.400 --> 00:02:30.370
ones.

00:02:30.370 --> 00:02:35.500
I remember the prison as a dark hole where
nothing happens.

00:02:35.500 --> 00:02:37.130
Nothing at all.

00:02:37.130 --> 00:02:41.360
When I arrived I was confused and disorientated.

00:02:41.360 --> 00:02:43.360
Then I got angry.

00:02:43.360 --> 00:02:47.390
Angry at a system that steals years from good,
innocent people.

00:02:47.390 --> 00:02:57.340
I only know this because I've spent time in
prison myself.

